+- A rejected store list receives exactly one safe `SERVER_ERROR` without store details, leaves the socket open, and logs the session id without conversation content or credentials ([validated by: contains a real store rejection in one safe SERVER_ERROR and logs its session without user content](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L207)).
+- A history request is answered outside the per-session turn lock while the same session has an unfinished turn, before that turn’s `stream_end` ([validated by: answers history while the same session has an unfinished turn holding its lock](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L231)).
